# Database & backups
/db/
/db/backups/
# Out-of-band pre-migration snapshots live in a SIBLING of this repo
# (../db-snapshots/), which is where every one of them has been taken. This
# anchored pattern exists because the obvious mistake is to create the folder
# HERE, one `git add .` away from committing a copy of the production
# database. Anchored, per C-26b (Batch 0.1): a bare pattern would swallow any
# directory of that name at any depth.
/db-snapshots/

# `/upload/` is an empty stray directory, ignored for tidiness.
#
# It is NOT where the images live, and this comment used to claim that user
# uploads "must not be committed" — which reads as a policy about
# `public/uploads/`, where the catalogue's 139 real images (49 MB) sit and
# ARE tracked. DD-16 (2026-09-05) decided to keep them tracked: git is
# currently their only version-controlled copy, and no restorable backup
# exists on the live install (L-46). Do not add public/uploads/ here.
/upload/

# Z.ai artifacts
_archive/
download/
agent-ctx/
worklog.md

# Playwright output (Batch 6.3). `test-results/` is the default outputDir and
# holds traces and screenshots of failures; CI uploads it as an artifact. Both
# are regenerated every run. Anchored, per C-26b.
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
